+# from the bank in milliseconds, without the model. See README_CHATBOT.md.
+#
+# Format: - { text: ..., tool: ..., args: {...}, state: <previous intent label>, source: ..., added: YYYY-MM-DD }
+# Never put case data here (names, numbers, ids): the wording only.
